  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique Engagement Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Having been signed in early 2022, the CPD is going into its mid-year of implementation and is fairly on track. The portfolio has grown resulting in a large and diverse portfolio of projects across a range of sectors, and now with a field presence and a healthy pipeline. The CO&#x2019;s resource envelope and delivery has grown exponentially, from US$19.6 million to US$34 million in the past three years. In 2024-25, the CO will seek to venture into new areas, testing innovations with scaling-up potential</narrative>
  </description>
